==={{BotW|-}}===
Side Hops are [[Jump]]s that can be performed by [[Link]] to leap to the left or right.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Side Hop}}<br/>Dodge enemy attacks by hopping sideways.|Ability Controls|BotW}}</ref> They can also be used to trigger [[Flurry Rush]]es if Link [[Perfect Dodging|Perfect Dodges]] an [[Enemy]] attack. In [[Ta'loh Naeg Shrine]], the [[Sheikah]] [[Monk]] [[Ta'loh Naeg]] instructs Link on how to use Side Hops to avoid attacks.<ref>{{Cite|Use a side hop to avoid enemy attacks. This will create an opening that you can use to strike back.|Ta'loh Naeg|BotW}}</ref>

